  "text": "PCIe_S90lite | addlink top of page S90 Lite GEN4X4 NVMe Addlink S90 Lite SSD features PCIe Gen 4 NVMe 1.4 Interface and delivers users a significant blazing fast performance boost with sequential read/write speeds of up to 5000/4200MB per second for the latest Intel and AMD platforms' desktops and laptops. The S90 Lite SSD supports HMB technology, which utilizes part of the host memory (DRAM) as if it were its own, and it's built with reliable 3D NAND to offer fantastic value. The S90 Lite is perfect for intensive use for a gamer, content creators, and in-demand engineers with cutting-edge technology. Explore the New Era of High Performance As a PCIe Gen4x4 SSD, the S90 Lite SSD delivers up to ten times faster than a SATA III SSD and around two times faster than Gen3X4 SSD. The S90 Lite SSD is also fully backward compatible with the PCIe Gen3x4 interface. SLC Cache & HMB Accelerate the Drive Performance The drive comes with an SLC caching to deliver better performance for a better user experience. It also supports a host memory buffer (HMB) that allows S90 Lite SSD to proactively pursue higher performance by utilizing the memory resource of the host to maximum random read/write performance for faster loading time & lag-free multitasking. Higher Compatibility with Superior Endurance and Reliability S90 Lite, built with quality 3D NAND Flash, supports the latest LDPC ECC technology, advanced Wear Leveling, Bad Block Management, and Over-Provisioning technology to ensure data accuracy and a longer SSD lifetime. The S90 Lite SSD is ready for the latest Intel and AMD Platforms and compatible with most PCs and laptops from all the major brands. It’s an ideal solution for gaming and hardware enthusiasts who are looking to build or upgrade their PC Furthermore, it is backed by addlink’s limited five years warranty. Medias Recommendation US JP UK bottom of page",
